<description>&lt;p&gt;France is negotiating a new defence agreement with Iraq that will extend to the Kurdistan Region, while Iran is accused of deliberately undermining Iraq's security. Iraqi intelligence cooperated with the UAE to seize 200,000 Captagon pills in a joint operation and the Iraqi government has suspended operations at the Al-Shib border crossing with Iran. ISIS claimed responsibility for an explosion that killed an Iraqi brigadier general and his aide. The Iraqi foreign minister met the International Crisis Group president to discuss security developments. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNbC1iaW5QNFdHaEJZT3NuTTFObjR2RVVoNHJJR2IxRjl4U3lvREs1RWoxN085OUFSc04taVlPVWRDdjZEQkl3ci1BTG9jTWFmOVFBXzh3dVFmUzR5UFFYbzZyVjFMd2pOYmpmaG9BQUwyd2RQbFJwd2VvTHZKTEdhaTk0bldWRE5HVS1WNG5scjNJZnpnWldKd2xDVlZkWU9zQ2lfN3RoVDRfdXFiSGFyWTBaaThwU3E4?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE03a2ZXd0p5YzNYNUJLLWk4NGtQT2dld2sxbldxc1l4NVlyNU9weC01UDZjV29pejZXQzhDb3dZX2tCY01TcGpfR25yOVp5a01rbTVoQmxHQjc2WnlOdnIwaWNCSWljbjI3QzFNZ3FqU0wzR3oyOWFEcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPZnZvWUYtQVFxRjhuX2N6d0Y1VUtta3g3enhyZU1QSjRfRzBqME9NQmJKMXJ4Z2lyYjhwMGMwQlRWY25Mby14VWh1TmpVRzZHcnl3REYyX1hSTklmM29hWkNYVWpKVTZoV19GMGtFSWhTS2xXM3VHQ3lLU3pHb0lMRFQ4NVE1TTdRa2VTS21URUlodnQ4QXgtaG51VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء